        "388"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8a07f9dd13ec73c3d298cf7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "将精神提升至LvMAX并完成养成\n※仅限Beyond Dreams 共同向前，共觅荣光",
      "source_fingerprint": "216aea99248f3639032da140faf93d45d8b1edefeb028fbaa8ea348829e61921",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "389"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3423e5fbe552ea3e7d2a5a11",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "属性【速度】达到800以上，并参加15次在草地的比赛",
      "source_fingerprint": "67de34ea49334141610dd532d09dedc5a02b0c97db471c9c34e43bb0612e710c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "39"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ce60c82998386d5087cbad3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赢得皋月赏、中山纪念，并达成有马纪念二连霸，且粉丝数达到480000人以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4752eb24a8d04f2190dd46ead23f89f8b818608ef3222c62004d2e0391bb610",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "390"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5aa734a3838437cf0cb61d42",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "取得阪神JF、大阪杯的胜利，\\n达成伊丽莎白女王杯两连霸，\\n其中在伊丽莎白女王杯（古马级）中以第1人气获胜",
      "source_fingerprint": "caf4749290a07dfe7f62c7f60552cf37da46a47a789e8783def439a94ac7d9e0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "391"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c67e6d0f575fdbdf45f58a9a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "取得樱花赏、橡树大赛、秋华赏的胜利，\\n达成伊丽莎白女王杯二连霸",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cb250c90457f807ec0858f8c7e705fc8d27f4522728de147f87228ce9652a80",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "392"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:681adf7cf79f30078995d107",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对莱茵力量、空中救世主、西沙里奥\\n分别获得1次以上的胜利，\\n且基础能力[力量]达到1200以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "78eeac64510f61bd7cb780a58c19b3b7c6a6ad9215ee26b65d7eef60dd81bf05",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "393"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b326bb49208a4ff788c20dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通过自主训练完成育成",
      "source_fingerprint": "0712ccfae378040022baf7443896f8c2704690e49bdc55d8186950b36e6ed921",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "394"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c2389224def9680ef816824",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在樱花赏、橡树大赛、秋华赏中获得胜利，\\n且战胜迷人景致4次以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd375211e8ffdaf079b51468e6f2b73bae942d09252e78b0904ac974dce5f567",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "395"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e919bb8e1ba89335f6269cb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在香豌豆锦标、橡树大赛、\\n秋华赏、天皇赏（春）中获得胜利，\\n且基础能力[智力]达到1200以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a452eda93230aaa0af0daeeaf4fc1f7aabcdb8c232e780a4d7a37727822733b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "396"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c93159847fc9b43e3fa65cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "执行20次试吃会\\n※欢迎光临！特雷森轩！ ～开始报恩了～限定",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6ce335ae846f7e25a12d644fa30dfbb71a5ee86e41aa3ae6c65410e6ff7ae3b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "397"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68d1589001e59a9ec41061cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用15个隐藏风味秘诀\\n※欢迎光临！特雷森轩！ ～开始报恩了～限定",
      "source_fingerprint": "aab40f4f306332429009344c05aae356b5bbe47b476bb3e701b3ffc4e8768ed2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "398"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ba9f1d0a2258c34daea03dd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在所有的拉面嘉年华中达成大盛况以上\\n※欢迎光临！特雷森轩！ ～开始报恩了～限定",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ddbafc46eec6df5ee40a996cfc06a166e91cf3c45be5c08fea91f7cc943a168",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "399"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9da6e0973af33237d50b351f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "参加1次以上的GⅠ，\\n并在GⅠ未获胜且育成等级C以上的状态完成育成",
      "source_fingerprint": "29d7298215876b05843d1f7741fbe63a545fc9fa682bb6a3f362fb3228039fb0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4ea1c66707b60b3524a846b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在参加过重赏但从未取得胜利的情况下，取得一次GⅠ级别比赛的胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "79d9020f1f912f54c5db8e2d800a18f737e32dac64e032ce45b3ebd9e04ac217",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "40"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fa1892b53436212ac67a37a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "获得50个面的诀窍\\n※欢迎光临！特雷森轩！ ～开始报恩了～限定",
      "source_fingerprint": "f508bf1c931e21ebafc6a19dfbb65ea53ce362d0e6d0690f27e00c1e757e060f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "400"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d760433918101068a864637",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "获得50个汤底的诀窍\\n※欢迎光临！特雷森轩！ ～开始报恩了～限定",
      "source_fingerprint": "4836bfebc4153256f2dcc8b08798f44758775251a6530d8527dc8352867e6c80",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "401"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77b44ba5923ef830dfd8c831",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "获得50个配料的诀窍\\n※欢迎光临！特雷森轩！ ～开始报恩了～限定",
      "source_fingerprint": "459ffb745f20a56d8a2e43cf8bc1228ef52952b4ca4bd5363b4f7c3be21e5095",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "402"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:267d123f2d0949f71d1d442f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在每日杯、皋月赏、日本德比、菊花赏、\\n宝冢纪念、天皇赏（秋）、日本杯、有马纪念中获得胜利，\\n且基础能力[智力]达到1200以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "638895aac00c71169ff86ed4d5d4dd85244ec7967d792526f35d8803ca260f52",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "403"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:045ad5119ebfe58b345eef0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在皋月赏、日本德比、\\n菊花赏、日本杯（资深级）中获胜，\\n且基础能力[力量]达到1200以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "e605477efa3ab8297844309f27476343ba0a682399b3d449b7544c2f3fd96526",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "404"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f39dcf9a67f06be705fc656",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在樱花赏、橡树大赛、秋华赏、\\n伊丽莎白女王杯（资深级）中获胜，且\\n基础能力[毅力]达到1200以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "704f4223981e5bdae4d13c6e69d90c78c8642169b6051639835512a4ba61a303",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "405"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37bc9843521fc3c3d27cd2a2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从在育成中未取得GⅠ胜利的继承赛马娘处继承心意，\\n在朝日杯FS、日本杯（经典级）取得胜利，\\n且粉丝数达到480000人以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "69123f292f52547a70dfb221a4a5ed7675d6495b1d4cc26067548b349f22746c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "406"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d78bd611ec2f24205a048c9c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "草地和沙土各取得胜利一次以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0c7a4161458a8d43758ba8b1967829f08a450cbde32b0263f4c186ed149516d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "41"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e665233f9f4124450503eaf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "参加比赛10次以上，且全部比赛均在3位以内完成育成\\n（注：「ワイド」是日本马券（马彩）的一种形式，包含两匹马的号码，\\n如果这两匹马同时进入前三则中奖）",
      "source_fingerprint": "65457adfb5be724e20bb28b8cc5c734931da1e28bf140533f0cc8c26be03198f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "42"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa492885555dd3387f931d9b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从育成过程中曾在橡树大赛获胜的赛马娘身上继承心意，\\n于橡树大赛、天皇赏（秋）取得胜利，\\n并且粉丝数达到320000人以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "917305e8f01edd19ffc5a0201a31074a087dffa5ed49fc1f36f54259ed26e52d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "43"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bc2473a59e1ed8b3862aab7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "取得阪神两岁雌马大赛的胜利，所有比赛都以干劲“绝好调”出战，\\n在没有过“变胖”、“皮肤粗糙”、“懒惰成性”的情况下\\n并且所有训练设施达到LV3以上完成育成",
      "source_fingerprint": "689ce782883e313e218831aa6d91f56d34420a28b12259aa51f1f2d90e05b203",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "44"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d54c0a9ca17f1acb36516b48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "参加重赏比赛达到23次以上，\\n并在人气第二以上的情况下取得菊花赏、天皇赏(春)的胜利；\\n且粉丝数达到32万以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd9789de0bc9ec6d2d9545417fe21474f1fa22e05173439cda80d5bf1760b10f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "45"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed853b1c90c3b65d34fce542",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用作战“居中”赢得日本德比和天皇赏（秋）\\n并且在育成结束时拥有“切れ者”(能人)育成状态",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b8d61d5aeb98a4434c20d8b0241ca5744219e50fb0f2d759b7126b8f4551fd2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "46"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0185988a3dd435643965ccba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以人气第1于弥生赏、皋月赏、日本德比、菊花赏取得胜利，\\n并于有马纪念（经典级）取得胜利，\\n且粉丝数达到240000人以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b91e4025e452d315505a0be4bb8a903497ff5e7629e0728789dac407684bbe1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "47"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4d7645af079bf1189d38d9a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从育成等级[S]以上的赛马娘身上继承心意，\\n以无败状态于希望锦标、弥生赏、皋月赏取得胜利，\\n并且属性[速度]达到1200以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c13052277cf94699640295fc74a40085e8c8bae0aa616ba5297f9ee91e92681",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "48"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4b7dc48f3453fdd2108c47e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "取得7次GⅠ级别比赛的胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4f142247e81d4b6b1f16b55c50959e30fbda9684f59bc87b0ef9375d8b57dc2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "49"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ae0167c623d49ad458180a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "粉丝数量达到55万人以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f90e2b1b2370648ca6278171ee25953edd2a2763f838371f5a5d412f973ca19",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1d5ee3e428e80ae82ec1000",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "取得高松宫纪念、短途马锦标、\\n安田纪念、英里冠军赛的胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5e2e3f1fc06949f15e8937c95cdc90b2988360c290f220b7732fefc450561d5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "50"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9801941f2046288aee76ace1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在包括天皇赏(春)、宝冢纪念、天皇赏(秋)、\\n日本杯、有马纪念的重赏中取得8次以上连胜",
      "source_fingerprint": "35dbd1947659b4ae309e8b2691d73e0f04e772dac038f8052e28e9b14d03bcbb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "51"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:676d5a27789693daf6f8a28a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "取得皋月赏、日本德比、菊花赏的胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "1185c0982bcbbd95831bcb80515cc11fca8f24cea48bc3818895e7343e01e840",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "52"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6cd50283fbba145c6834c1b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "胜率85%以上，\\n并取得GⅠ级别比赛的胜利达到7次以上，且粉丝数达到32万人以上完成育成",
      "source_fingerprint": "de4c58444f6a6abf8a42c26f62c4e1be1eae8fe405ed6d0a9efe4d53ed3e604b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "54"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc98a356153f12d14d3e8e54",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "保持连胜的状态下取得GⅠ级别比赛7胜以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "5361e9070d37ab92f0817c7400703e3f8da37fcb8fe089e80d6768f4a6ce85fb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
